1 NOTE {geni:about_me} Overview: This Anna Osmundsdatter was born around 1790 in Lye, Time, Rogaland.  She was at Helland in 1801 FT, her 1804 konfirmasjon and in 1820 for her datter Anna's baptism.  In 1865 FT we see her at Rosseland wi
2 CONC th her datter Anna's family.  Anna Osm. did not marry.  Both of her datters were with Anders Asbiornsen, 7 years apart, while he was married to someone else.  Perhaps likely her father is one of the 3 Osmunds (f.1745-1751) at Garb
2 CONC org in 1801FT: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/census/person/pf01058353001023
