1 NAME Lars Mauritsson /Mauritsson/
2 GIVN Lars Mauritsson
2 SURN Mauritsson
2 _MARNM Fjermedal
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 DATE 1685
2 PLAC Fjermedal i Bjerkreim Rogaland; Bjerkreimsboka III s 2091 31A.1
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Norge
1 DEAT
2 DATE 3 FEB 1732
