1 NAME Bereta Ellingsdotter Rott
1 SEX F
1 BIRT
2 DATE ABT 1711
2 PLAC Rott, Sola, Rogaland, Norway
2 ADDR
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1773
2 ADDR
3 CITY Stavanger
3 STAE Rogaland
