1 NOTE Children:
2 CONT 1. Torres Gitlesen b. 1591 Lived in Vig abd Orre aand was lensmann in Hauglandskipreide
2 CONT 2.Rasmus Gitleson
2 CONT 3. Mogens Gitleson b. 1599, d 1683, m. Anna Tjolad from Orre. Lived in Oksnevad and was a lensmann stter faren.
2 CONT 4. Sivert eller Sjur Gitleson vert i 1675 kalla "Siffuer Grodem".
2 CONT 5. Nils Gitleson, lived  first in Orre and then Obrestad
2 CONT 6. Guri Gitlesd var gift til Sole
2 CONT 7. Kirsti Gitlesd, m. klokkar i Klepp, Tore Hauge
2 CONT 8. Anna Gitland 
2 CONT 9. Barbro Gitland, m Ljude Re
2 CONT 10 Guri Gitland m lensmann Pedar Nortensen from Bjerkreim
