2 CONT The first Homemakers Club in this community [Hampden] was organized March 20, 1935, with 18 members.  The officers were Mrs. Clarence Hedlund, president;  Mrs. O.W. Neidlinger, vice president;  Mrs. Glenn (Helen) Neidlinger, secre
