1 OCCU
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Viede 1893, Klokkerbok for Lye prestegjeld, Time sokn 1889-1909, https://www.digitalarkivet.no/view/327/pv00000007285500
2 CONT * Viede 1893, Lye sokneprestkontor, AV/SAST-A-101794/001/30/30BB/L0008: Klokkerbok nr. B 8, 1889-1909, s. 204, Brukslenke for sidevisning: https://www.digitalarkivet.no/kb20070219650575
2 CONT * Hetland skipreide i 450 år. 2 : Helleland sokn : gard, ætt og folk, Rapstad, side 739, nr. 63.f, https://www.nb.no/items/URN:NBN:no-nb_digibok_2018030748152?page=747
2 CONT
2 CONT To America.
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.findagrave.com/memorial/67897358/jacob-l-rapstad
2 CONT
2 CONT Mr. Rapstad is a native of Stavanger, Norway, where he was born on March 11, 1869, being one of the nine children of Larace and Anna (Torson) Rapstad, who passed their entire lives in Norway, where the father has followed the voca
2 CONC tion of farming.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1883 he immigrated to America, landed in New York and went to Lake Park, Becker county, Minn., where he remained a short time, and later located in Norman county, where he remained two and one half years. In March 1886, he came
2 CONC  to Montana and first engaged in sheep herding. After 2 years in various localities he finally purchased nearly 3,000 acres of land on Big Timber creek, which he sold in 1896 and then purchased his present place, which was known a
2 CONC s the Dunham ranch, now known as Viking Springs stock ranch.
2 CONT
2 CONT In 1892 Mr. Rapstad visited his native land, going thither in December, and in January he was there united in marriage to Miss Anna Maulin, daughter of James Maulin of Stavanger, Norway. They are the parents of five children: Lewi
2 CONC s and Annie twins; Agnes, Bessie, Jennie Josephine; Amanda and Agnes, deceased.
2 CONT
2 CONT Suggested edit: Death Certificate:
2 CONT Father: Lars Nepstad born in Norway
2 CONT Mother: not listed
2 CONT Informant: L.J. Rapstad of Big Timber, Montana
2 CONT Wife: Martha Rapstad
2 CONT He had lived in Sweet Grass County for 37 years and was a wool grower.
2 CONT He was born in Helleland, Norway
2 CONT Contributor: Julia Kinsey (48922386)
